WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.901
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers,
and this is "Late Night".

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.434
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:06.267
[ Audience cheering ]
That's great to hear.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:07.934
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:10.367
The House of Representatives
voted yesterday

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.200
to remove
Speaker Kevin McCarthy.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.767
Well, Kevin, don't cry
because it's over,

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:16.767
cry because it happened.

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:17.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:19.501
That's right,
the House voted yesterday

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:21.901
to remove a speaker
from power

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:23.868
for the first time
in 234 years.

00:00:23.868 --> 00:00:25.734
Well, they removed him
from office.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:28.400
It's hard to have power
when you have all the fire

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.534
and charisma of
the Facebook silhouette guy.

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:33.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.834
I mean, look at his face.

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.701
This is a man
who either got removed --

00:00:37.701 --> 00:00:39.634
He either got removed
as speaker

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:42.701
or was just called
his brother's name in bed.

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:45.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.567
[ Mimicking McCarthy ]
"Do I -- Do I say something

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:52.067
or do I just let it go?"

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:55.767
The Biden administration
announced today

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:59.133
that it will forgive $9 billion
in student loans.

00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.434
"Well, that should at least
cover most of it",

00:01:01.434 --> 00:01:03.734
said one NYU kid.

00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:06.734
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.701
[ Mimicking NYU kid ] "Still
probably need to get a job."

00:01:09.701 --> 00:01:12.000
[ Chuckles ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.434
Manhattan Supreme Court
Judge Arthur Engorgon --

00:01:15.434 --> 00:01:17.234
Uh, no, that's Engoron,
sorry.

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:19.400
Manhattan Supreme Court
Judge Arthur Engoron

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.133
placed a limited gag order
yesterday

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:23.400
on former President Trump
for his civil fraud trial,

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.067
which, if violated,

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.234
carries a penalty
of up to 30 days in jail.

00:01:27.234 --> 00:01:29.901
Seriously? The guy eats
nothing but fast food

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:31.767
and lives in a Florida
swamp hotel.

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:34.334
You're not going to
break him with jail.

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:35.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:36.934
He'll come out rested and ready

00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:38.834
with three new lawyers.

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:41.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.934
During his civil fraud
trial yesterday,

00:01:43.934 --> 00:01:45.801
former President Trump's son,
Eric,

00:01:45.801 --> 00:01:47.834
was reportedly seen
biting his nails,

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:50.534
but Trump put a stop to it.

00:01:50.534 --> 00:01:53.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:59.267
Police in Slovakia recently
shared a traffic camera photo

00:01:59.267 --> 00:02:00.868
of what appears
to be a dog

00:02:00.868 --> 00:02:03.601
behind the wheel
of a speeding car.

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:07.467
He got pulled over, but he
swears the light was gray.

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:10.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:11.434
It's a good joke.

00:02:11.434 --> 00:02:13.100
It's a good joke...

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:16.868
[ Cheers and applause ]
...about dogs being colorblind.

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:21.667
Scotland's took the funniest
picture of the day

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:24.701
and found a very boring thing
to drill down on.

00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:26.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.934
Today was International Walk
to School Day.

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:32.267
This news first reported
by a hungover mom.

00:02:32.267 --> 00:02:33.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.801 --> 00:02:35.267
[ Mimicking woman ]
"Hey, good news.

00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:37.334
It's a holiday."

00:02:37.334 --> 00:02:40.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:43.834
"Shhhhh."

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:45.701
Taco Bell announced
yesterday it will offer

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:47.601
a so-called taco lover pass

00:02:47.601 --> 00:02:50.067
that allows customers
to get a taco every day

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:51.868
for one month for just $10.

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:53.901
So if you love tacos,
maybe you try

00:02:53.901 --> 00:02:56.167
getting them somewhere
other than Taco Bell.

00:02:56.167 --> 00:02:58.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:01.767
That's right, Taco Bell
will offer customers a $10 pass

00:03:01.767 --> 00:03:05.000
that allows them to get one taco
every day for one month,

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.534
though it's never a good sign

00:03:06.534 --> 00:03:08.467
when your promotion
sounds like a punishment

00:03:08.467 --> 00:03:10.634
from a parent in the 1950's.

00:03:10.634 --> 00:03:14.300
[ Mimicking parent ]
"Oh, you like tacos?

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.767
We'll see how much you like
tacos in a month, wise guy."

00:03:17.767 --> 00:03:18.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:21.167
[ Mimicking child ]
"What a day."

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:23.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.901 --> 00:03:27.801
Google announced yesterday
it may no longer deliver e-mails

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:31.033
from users whose messages
are frequently marked as spam.

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:32.767
In other news,
Crate &amp; Barrel's stock

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:35.067
plunged more than 30% today.

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:36.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:38.534
And finally,
Paramount Pictures yesterday

00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:40.467
uploaded the entire movie
"Mean Girls"

00:03:40.467 --> 00:03:42.567
onto the social media platform
TikTok.

00:03:42.567 --> 00:03:45.434
But if you really want
to see "Mean Girls" on TikTok,

00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:47.267
just read the comments.

00:03:47.267 --> 00:03:49.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.634
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:52.634 --> 00:03:53.634
We're up and running.

